          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Here’s a community of women just like you, sharing practical advice they \"wish someone had told them sooner\"—<a href=\"/blogs/outfit-ideas/my-story\" title=\"Why FANY Classic smartwatch is the Ultimate 24/7 Accessory for Modern Women?\">7-day fashion looks, office stress relief</a>, <a href=\"/blogs/news/playing-poker-help-women\" title=\"Work Stress? This FANY Classic Style Smartwatch Detects Your Mood and Helps You Relax!\">emotional self-awareness guides</a>, <a href=\"https://fany.us/blogs/news/3-ways-fany-smartwatches-helped-me-reclaim-sleep\" title=\"https://fany.us/blogs/news/3-ways-fany-smartwatches-helped-me-reclaim-sleep\">2-month sleep improvement tips</a>, <a href=\"https://fany.us/blogs/news/4-ways-fany-transforms-period-tracking-into-self-care\" title=\"https://fany.us/blogs/news/4-ways-fany-transforms-period-tracking-into-self-care\">4 methods of menstrual self-care</a>, health & fitness, gift-giving ideas, and more real-life stories.<br/>Follow us on <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/fany.global/\" title=\"https://www.instagram.com/fany.global/\">Instagram</a>, <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61576440855579\" title=\"https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61576440855579\">Facebook</a>, <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/groups/1027201679148074\" title=\"https://www.facebook.com/groups/1027201679148074\">Facebook Group</a>, <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@fanyglobal\" title=\"https://www.youtube.com/@fanyglobal\">YouTube</a>, and <a href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@fany_global?lang=zh-Hans\" title=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@fany_global?lang=zh-Hans\">TikTok</a>… Unlock more 'invisible self-care' hacks. Join thousands of women turning everyday moments into <br/>#FANYVibes elegance.\" </p>",
